<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69392" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρσῐνοειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>myrtle-like</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄζοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					81
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Medic.,
				<i>shaped like a myrtle leaf</i>, of an incision, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.23.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				15.5
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.8.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.886
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρσινοειδές, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληματίς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
